        "q": "Does Paytm HDFC Bank Select Credit Card offer milestone benefits?",
        "a": "Paytm HDFC Bank Select Credit Card offers milestone benefit on spending Rs. 50,000 in a calendar quarter. On achieving this milestone, you get a gift voucher worth Rs. 500. When you are eligible for this benefit, you will be informed of the same by the bank."
      },
      {
        "q": "How do I get the credit card statement for Paytm HDFC Bank Select Credit Card?",
        "a": "You will receive your Paytm HDFC Bank Select Credit Card statement via email to your registered email address. Apart from that, you can view your statement and download it by logging into your HDFC Bank net banking account."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I apply online for Paytm HDFC Bank Select Credit Card?",
        "a": "Yes, you can apply online by visiting the official website of HDFC Bank and navigating to the respective card page. You are required to submit the duly filled application form along with relevant documents. Besides this, you can also apply online through Paytm app by submitting the online application."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I earn rewards on bill payments via Paytm HDFC Bank Select Credit Card?",
        "a": "Yes, the card offers 5% Cashpoints on Paytm spends, including utility bill payments. However, you cannot earn rewards on bill payments via any other app."
      },
